+3. Define F-count confirmation separately from raw node-count.
+4. Build X-axis extreme taxonomy.
+5. Build Y-axis phase permission logic.
+6. Build multi-timeframe state alignment.
+7. Test lower-timeframe reverse entries inside higher-timeframe continuation states.
